  "notes": "GH-468 finding 7 reduced to bytes: a bytewise walk over an 8-byte stack buffer whose end address is also the next object. The bound must render on the walked buffer (&v1[8]) and the buffer must be one char [8]; the absent clauses reject the neighbour-bound render. endptrbound off restores it."
}
